  "synopsis": "The stories that lie within the cards come to life...",
  "background": "Yu-Gi-Oh! Card Game: The Chronicles is a series of monthly anime shorts showcasing Official Card Game-original (i.e. not from the Yu-Gi-Oh! anime/manga) card themes. It is an expansion of the demo reel of the same name released the previous year. The first arc is a retelling of one fight from the lore of the \"Sky Striker\" theme. The second arc is an adaptation of the [/i]The Fallen & The Virtuous[/i] storyline's first part, involving the \"Dogmatika\", \"Tri-Brigade\", \"Springans\", and \"Branded\" themes. The third arc features the \"Charmer\" theme.",
